          "node_id": "COCH50_CH50ZO_ARTVIRE",
          "quote": "Editor's note\u2014 Ord. No. 2020-21, \u00a7 1, effective August 8, 2020, repealed Art. VI, Divs. 1\u20144, Subdivs. A\u2014D, Secs. 50-6-1\u201450-6-25, 50-6-41\u201450-6-58, 50-6-71\u201450-6-94, 50-6-111\u201450-6-115, 50-6-131\u201450-6-134, 50-6-151\u201450-6-153 and 50-6-171\u201450-6-179, Signs. Former art. VI pertained to signs and derived from Secs. 61-6-1\u201461-6-23, 61-6-25, 61-6-26, 61-6-31\u201461-6-47, 61-6-49, 61-6-51\u201461-6-74, 61-6-82\u201461-6-85, 61-6-91\u201461-6-94, 61-6-101\u201461-6-103, 61-6-111\u201461-6-119 of the Code of 1984; Ord. No. 11-05, \u00a7 1(61-6-1\u201461-6-23, 61-6-31\u201461-6-47, 61-6-49, 61-6-51\u201461-6-74, 61-6-82\u201461-6-85. 61-6-91\u201461-6-94, 61-6-101\u2014616-103, 61-6-111\u201461-6-119), effective May 28, 2005; Ord. No. 34-05, \u00a7 1(61-6-1, 61-6-2, 61-6-14, 61-6-21, 61-6-39, 61-6-41, 61-6-74, 61-6-81), effective December 6, 2005; Ord. No. 44-06, \u00a7 1(61-6-2, 61-6-5\u201461-6-6, 61-6-14, 61-6-67, 61-6-82\u201461-6-84), effective December 21, 2006; Ord. No. 24-08, \u00a7 1(61-6-2), effective November 1, 2008; Ord. No. 13-11, \u00a7 1(61-6-1, 61-6-6, 61-6-13, 61-6-41, 61-6-82, 61-6-83), effective August 23, 2011; Ord. No. 23-13, \u00a7 1(61-6-25\u201461-6-26, 61-6-34, 61-6-42, 61-6-91), effective August 28, 2013; Ord. No. 38-14, \u00a7 1(61-6-1), effective October 26, 2014; and Ord. No. 20-16, \u00a7 1(61-6-42), effective June 16, 2016. Similar provisions can now be found in Chapter 4, Articles IV and V.",
